---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Privacy & external services | Get Cited" description="What this static Get Cited website does and how hosting and external links affect privacy.">
  <main id="main-content" class="policy mx-auto max-w-4xl px-5 py-10">
    <header><p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase text-blue-800">Get Cited project</p><h1 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900">Privacy &amp; external services</h1></header>
    <p>This website serves static article pages. The application has no accounts, contact forms, advertising scripts, client-side analytics, or application cookies. You can read the article without signing in.</p>
<h2>Hosting</h2><p>Vercel delivers the website and may process network requests and operational logs under its own policies. This page does not claim that hosting produces no logs. Read <a href="https://vercel.com/legal/privacy-policy">Vercel’s privacy policy</a> for the provider’s practices.</p>
<h2>External links and corrections</h2><p>Links to research publications, the United Nations, the Department of Energy, and GitHub take you to services with their own policies. Feedback submitted through GitHub is processed by GitHub and may be public. Do not post sensitive information in a public issue.</p>
<h2>Scope</h2><p>This statement describes this version of the static application. If forms, analytics, or other data collection are added, the statement should be reviewed before those features are released. <a href="/contact/">Contact the project</a> about privacy or content questions.</p>
    <p><a href="/">Return to the evidence review</a></p>
  </main>
  <footer class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-5 py-8 text-sm text-slate-600">Get Cited project · Updated <time datetime="2026-10-14">14 October 2026</time></footer>
</Layout>
<style>.policy :global(p), .policy :global(ol) { margin-top: 1rem; line-height: 1.8; } .policy :global(h2) { margin-top: 2rem; font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 700; } .policy :global(a) { color: #1e40af; text-decoration: underline; } .policy :global(ol) { list-style: decimal; padding-left: 1.5rem; }</style>
